{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"41c1797ceb4744bb8fe83765574ac6ac","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"b4ed5e9fa063da481baaf1dab10278e9216e","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=b4ed5e9fa063da481baaf1dab10278e9216e","view_num":436,"pub_timestamp":"1707122991","title":"2월 5일 업데이트 개선사항","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=b4ed5e9fa063da481baaf1dab10278e9216e","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"5ed747df8143bb93cdf8a09fc6bef24d\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[모바일\u0026amp;PC\u0026nbsp;공통\u0026nbsp;개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;니케의\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;오탈자\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;표현\u0026nbsp;방식을\u0026nbsp;다듬었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;효과는\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;마르차나\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「드론\u0026nbsp;서포터」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;홍련\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;흑영\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「화무십일홍\u0026nbsp;·\u0026nbsp;파죽」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;레드\u0026nbsp;후드\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「레드\u0026nbsp;울프」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;레드\u0026nbsp;후드\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「와일드\u0026nbsp;투스」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;토브\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「급조\u0026nbsp;탄환」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;토브\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「개조\u0026nbsp;성공」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;아니스\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;스파클링\u0026nbsp;서머\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「스파클링\u0026nbsp;미사일」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;목단\u0026nbsp;「여긴\u0026nbsp;내가\u0026nbsp;맡는다!」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;마스트\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「해적의\u0026nbsp;근성」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;길로틴\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「흑화」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└ 스노우 화이트 : 이노센트 버스트 스킬 「세븐스 드워프 Ⅲ」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2. 네온 스킬1 「네온 특제탄」의 이펙트가 잘못된 대상에게 출력되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;기존에도\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;효과는\u0026nbsp;정상\u0026nbsp;적용되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.노이즈\u0026nbsp;-\u0026nbsp;클래식\u0026nbsp;디바의\u0026nbsp;장전\u0026nbsp;모션을\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;자연스럽게\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;목단\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「여긴\u0026nbsp;내가\u0026nbsp;맡는다!」와\u0026nbsp;비스킷\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「터그\u0026nbsp;놀이」의\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;동시에\u0026nbsp;적용되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e5. PvP에서 일부 위치의 SG 무기 니케에게 적정 사거리 효과가 적용되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;메어리\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「백의의\u0026nbsp;천사」의\u0026nbsp;방어력\u0026nbsp;증가\u0026nbsp;버프가\u0026nbsp;아군에게\u0026nbsp;적용되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7. 스페셜 아레나에서 이전 라운드의 버프 아이콘이 사라지지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e8. 특정 상황에서 협동작전 전투 중 니케를 조작할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;타일런트급\u0026nbsp;랩쳐\u0026nbsp;알트아이젠의\u0026nbsp;작전\u0026nbsp;정보\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;중복되는\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명을\u0026nbsp;하나로\u0026nbsp;통합하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;미사일\u0026nbsp;포트\u0026nbsp;I,\u0026nbsp;II\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;터렛\u0026nbsp;II,\u0026nbsp;IV\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e10. 요격전에 등장하는 그레이브디거가 특정 조건에서 일부 공격 스킬을 사용하지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e11.\u0026nbsp;타일런트급\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;모더니아\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;입장\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;연출을\u0026nbsp;스킵하지\u0026nbsp;않아도\u0026nbsp;코어를\u0026nbsp;사격하도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e12.\u0026nbsp; \u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;엄폐\u0026nbsp;상태일\u0026nbsp;때\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;조건에서\u0026nbsp;아군의\u0026nbsp;엄폐\u0026nbsp;상태가\u0026nbsp;해제되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e13.\u0026nbsp;도감\u0026nbsp;속\u0026nbsp;목단의\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;내용\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;오탈자를\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;소규\u0026nbsp;조직\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[수정]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;소규모\u0026nbsp;조직\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Nanum Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e콘텐츠\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e/시스템\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;상점을\u0026nbsp;무료로\u0026nbsp;갱신할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있을\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;알림\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;레벨업과\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;레벨업\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;간이\u0026nbsp;인벤토리\u0026nbsp;기능을\u0026nbsp;추가하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3. 특정 상황에서 아카이브 상세 화면의 보상 획득 수량이 잘못 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;최초\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;튜토리얼이\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트의\u0026nbsp;하드\u0026nbsp;난이도\u0026nbsp;스테이지에\u0026nbsp;빠른\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;하드\u0026nbsp;난이도의\u0026nbsp;마지막\u0026nbsp;스테이지에는\u0026nbsp;적용되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트의\u0026nbsp;기록\u0026nbsp;보관소\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;배너\u0026nbsp;이미지가\u0026nbsp;출력되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;사용성을\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;솔로레이드\u0026nbsp;메인\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;랩쳐\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;보상\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e8. 협동작전 편성 화면에서 간헐적으로 버스트 스킬 아이콘이 잘못 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장에\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e로드\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e급\u0026nbsp;랩쳐와\u0026nbsp;전투할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;스테이지를\u0026nbsp;추가하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e10.\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터에서\u0026nbsp;기믹과\u0026nbsp;상호\u0026nbsp;작용할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;이동\u0026nbsp;중인\u0026nbsp;스쿼드가\u0026nbsp;정지하도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e11. 로스트 섹터에서 상호작용 할 수 없는 위치의 스쿼드 및 어시스트가 서로 상호작용 할 수 있는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e12.\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터에서\u0026nbsp;문\u0026nbsp;또는\u0026nbsp;벽\u0026nbsp;너머의\u0026nbsp;대상과\u0026nbsp;상호작용이\u0026nbsp;가능한\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;기믹,\u0026nbsp;로봇,\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e13.\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u0026nbsp;튜토리얼\u0026nbsp;진행시\u0026nbsp;난이도\u0026nbsp;목록이\u0026nbsp;일시적으로\u0026nbsp;어색하게\u0026nbsp;보이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e14.\u0026nbsp;스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나에서\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;이전\u0026nbsp;라운드의\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;아이콘이\u0026nbsp;남아있는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e15. 선행 퀘스트가 있는 상황에서 캠페인 스테이지에 진입을 시도할 경우 선행 퀘스트 안내 팝업이 표시되도록 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e16.\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;테두리\u0026nbsp;보상\u0026nbsp;상한이\u0026nbsp;확장되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;전\u0026nbsp;이미\u0026nbsp;달성한\u0026nbsp;순위의\u0026nbsp;보상은\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;입장\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;지급됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[특정\u0026nbsp;순위\u0026nbsp;달성\u0026nbsp;횟수]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;50회\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;100회\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;150회\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;200회\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;275회\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;350회\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e17.\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;특전\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;별로\u0026nbsp;쉽게\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;페이지를\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e18.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠의\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;버튼\u0026nbsp;효과음을\u0026nbsp;상황에\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;어울리도록\u0026nbsp;변경하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;-\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;하모니\u0026nbsp;큐브\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;-\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;장비\u0026nbsp;레벨업\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;전초기지\u0026nbsp;-\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;리사이클\u0026nbsp;룸\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e19.\u0026nbsp;싱크로\u0026nbsp;디바이스\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;레벨업\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;아이콘을\u0026nbsp;터치할\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;정보\u0026nbsp;팝업이\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e20.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;D-OUTSIDERS의\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;「공범자」에서\u0026nbsp;선택지에\u0026nbsp;따른\u0026nbsp;컷씬이\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e21.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;협동작전\u0026nbsp;파티\u0026nbsp;구성\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;파티원의\u0026nbsp;프로필을\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e22.\u0026nbsp; \u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e월페이퍼\u0026nbsp;최초\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;다섯\u0026nbsp;개의\u0026nbsp;페이지가\u0026nbsp;모두\u0026nbsp;설정되어\u0026nbsp;있을\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;교체\u0026nbsp;대상을\u0026nbsp;선택할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e23.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;업적의\u0026nbsp;상한이\u0026nbsp;확장되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;레벨\u0026nbsp;첫\u0026nbsp;달성\u0026nbsp;업적\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;업적\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;개수가\u0026nbsp;달성\u0026nbsp;목표인\u0026nbsp;업적\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e기타\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점에\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;BGM을\u0026nbsp;적용하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;주크박스의\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;앨범에서\u0026nbsp;다음곡\u0026nbsp;재생\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;앨범의\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;Blue\u0026nbsp;Water\u0026nbsp;Island\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;Outer\u0026nbsp;Automata\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-fam